  "title": "Employee Dependant Exceptions — Create / Edit",
  "entity": "HCMv3.PersonnelAdministration.EmployeeDependantException",
  "overviewHtml": "<p>Overrides one dependant's ticket or health reimbursement entitlement for a period. The period must fall within the dependant's own dates.</p><p>For health reimbursement, the amount replaces that dependant's share. For tickets, the time engine uses it when accruing the dependant's ticket.</p>",
